1
00:00:00,983 --> 00:00:03,357
You are a fish seller.

2
00:00:03,983 --> 00:00:07,847
Rule one. Greet your first customer.

3
00:00:08,667 --> 00:00:11,293
YOU: Good morning, sir!

4
00:00:11,333 --> 00:00:13,610
GULL: SQUAWK.

5
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:15,943
He did not pay.

6
00:00:15,983 --> 00:00:19,960
Rule two. Never haggle with a grandma.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,627
GRANDMA: Two pounds.

8
00:00:22,667 --> 00:00:25,333
YOU: It’s ten!

9
00:00:26,983 --> 00:00:29,277
Somehow, you paid her.

10
00:00:29,317 --> 00:00:33,086
Rule three. Make sure the fish is dead.

11
00:00:34,667 --> 00:00:36,667
THE FISH: Nope.

12
00:00:40,317 --> 00:00:42,567
It was not.

13
00:00:43,333 --> 00:00:45,293
GULL: SQUAWK.

14
00:00:45,333 --> 00:00:47,943
GRANDMA: Keep the change, dear.

15
00:00:47,983 --> 00:00:51,458
Rule four. Never leave your stall.

16
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:54,073
You were a fish seller.

